          news: "•Updated the classic quick play map rotation, thanks to Oo 0 oO for helping with this. The quickplay matchmaking algorithm is being adjusted over the next few days to place a higher priority on similar skill level and a lower priority on geographical distance.\r\n•Added /roomname, /roompass, and /clearroompass commands to change custom room name and password settings from within the room.\r\n•Added /clear command to clear the chat",
